        "path_or_url": "wiki/Architecture.md",
        "section": "Architecture > Docs MCP runtime",
        "snippet": "Internally, project context retrieval is staged: documentation first, then bounded source evidence, repository map, and code graph only when deterministic unresolved-target or cross-module signals require them. A versioned routing record stores stage status/reason/count/bytes outside the canonical model projection. Repository maps remain navigation evidence and never become authoritative project policy.",
